          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vaisilaeli váikele eneo lya ku Gosheni nchilambo cha ku Misili. Na pavanavele aneko, nkupata dimali dyohe na vánivelekana namene na kuyenjejeka namene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo nkuikala nchilambo cha ku Misili kwa uhiku wa vyaka kumi na saba, mpaka pahwikihije vyaka myamoja alubaini na saba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
