          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhiku wa kuhwa kwake paunavele pepi, Yakobo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47:29",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Apano pàlembwije Isilaeli, kwamba lina linji lyanga Yakobo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nkunchema Yusufu mwanawe nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Hambi, ikàva wako ùnikatapaliwa na nangu, bahi nguahidi kwa kutaya nkono wako munnyonga wangu kuva, uchiungutendele uwambone na uchiukulupike. Unangusike akuno ku Misili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ila panimbehila na kuhwena unaikala pamo na anakuluvangu vahidîle tangu, ungutwale apano pa Misili koka ukangusike munsati wavo.” Yusufu nkuchidoni, “Nguchingutende muchi chunguhaulidile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Ngwapilile!” Yusufu nkumwapilila. Bahi Isilaeli, yani Yakobo nkutepehija muti wake mpata wa kumuti wa chinanda chake, nkumwabudu Nnungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
